caption_text:
A while ago, we released COMBINE Blocks — a six-part audiovisual series exploring the creative process through motion. Instead of focusing on the final outcome, we looked at everything that comes before it: uncertainty, experimentation, structure, and dialogue that gradually shape an idea into something real.
Here are all six chapters in one place: from the first spark and emerging forms to momentum, system-building, refinement, and collaboration. Swipe through the journey — one stage at a time.
